          "description": "Added Phase 3A spatial features: EPO/GCSF gradients, compartment volumes, adaptive transcription transitions",
          "changes": [
            "EPO_external: Added diffusion (100 μm²/s), gradient (1 µM/µm x-axis), volume (10 fL)",
