            "Nuclear places: Set volume to 0.5 fL (stochastic regime)",
            "Cytoplasmic places: Set volume to 4.5 fL (continuous regime)",
            "GATA1_transcription: Changed to adaptive (threshold 1.0 fL, filter inputs_only)",
